+2.  **Independent Surface Extraction:** For each active cell at the selected level, extract the isosurface elements independently. Do not query or track neighboring cells for connectivity purposes [S1].
+3.  **Render Independent Elements:** Render the surface elements found at each cell. No reconnection of surface elements between adjacent cells is performed [S1].
